                        "glosses": [
                            "In the manner of the French or their language."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4039018-05db-4816-95ee-1a0dfc5ad3f5",
                                "sense_id": "0430c5a4-dede-3bdf-8277-f080dc150011",
                                "text": "Van Kampen, who anticipated Motley in disparaging the Walloons as being Frenchly fickle..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad65508f-db67-4b71-9e19-de23c821740e",
                                "sense_id": "0430c5a4-dede-3bdf-8277-f080dc150011",
                                "text": "He thought it indecorous to have a young and pretty girl packing with him in his room. He was thinking so Frenchly, that it even seemed to him Bess should not have proposed it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "553c371f-7a1e-4d0e-9656-245396be1a55",
                                "sense_id": "0430c5a4-dede-3bdf-8277-f080dc150011",
                                "text": "I realized how unlike his true self he had been; he was Frenchly warm today, and Frenchly open and reasonable."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
